---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Corrections">
  <section style="padding:2.5rem 0 1rem; max-width:70ch;">
    <h1>Corrections</h1>
    <p class="lede">We log changes to classifications, metadata and source links here.</p>
    <p>No corrections have been published yet. When one is, the previous entry and the revised entry both remain visible, with a dated note explaining what changed and why.</p>
    <p>To report an error, open an issue in the repository or email the maintainer. We correct in public.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
